<title>USA: Consolidated Graphics to buy Austin Printing.</title>
<headline>Consolidated Graphics to buy Austin Printing.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consolidated Graphics Inc said Tuesday it signed a letter of intent to acquire Austin Printing Co Inc of Atlanta in a non-taxable stock-for-stock transaction.</p>
<p>Other terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Austin Printing Co is a commercial printer.</p>
<p>Upon completion of pending announced acquisitions, Consolidated Graphics would operate 22 companies in 17 markets with annualized run-rate revenues in excess of $200 million.</p>
</text>
